@722 = ~Ghost Armor (Evocation)
Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 7 rounds + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a magical field of force that protects like plate armor (AC 3). Its protection stacks with Dexterity and shield bonuses. The Ghost Armor spell does not hinder movement, adds no weight or encumbrance, nor does it prevent spellcasting. At a high level the warlord can improve this spell and create an armor that grants an AC of 2 at level 10, of 1 at level 17 and of 0 at level 24. It lasts until dispelled or until the duration runs out.~
@7221 = ~Ghost Armor (Evocation)
Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 27 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a magical field of force that protects like plate armor (AC 0). Its protection stacks with Dexterity and shield bonuses. The Ghost Armor spell does not hinder movement, adds no weight or encumbrance, nor does it prevent spellcasting. It lasts until dispelled or until the duration runs out.~
@7222 = ~Ghost Armor (Evocation)
Level: 2
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 27 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a magical field of force around the recipient that protects like plate armor (AC 1). Its protection stacks with Dexterity and shield bonuses. The Ghost Armor spell does not hinder movement, adds no weight or encumbrance, nor does it prevent spellcasting. At level 24 the warlord can improve this spell and create an armor that grants an AC of 0. It lasts until dispelled or until the duration runs out.~
@72221 = ~Ghost Armor (Evocation)
Level: 2
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 27 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a magical field of force around the recipient that protects like plate armor (AC 1). Its protection stacks with Dexterity and shield bonuses. The Ghost Armor spell does not hinder movement, adds no weight or encumbrance, nor does it prevent spellcasting. At level 24 the warlord can improve this spell and create an armor that grants an AC of 0. It lasts until dispelled or until the duration runs out.

All allies within 5 meters of the target benefit from the reduced effects of the spell: Armor Class of 2 for 18 rounds (Armor Class of 1 at level 24 of warlord).~

@723 = ~Good Luck~
@724 = ~Good Luck (Enchantment)
Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds / level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell subtly alters the course of events in the warlord's favor. Its benefits vary and depend on caster level.
Each round, a d6 determines how luck favors the warlord:
1: Nothing
2: Enemy Blunder: bonus to AC
3: Luck: bonus to saving throws
4: Helpful observation: bonus to hit
5: Exceptional Strike: bonus to damage
6: Chance: additional attack and bonus to hit or damage.

The applied bonus is equal to +1 every 3 levels of the caster (maximum +5 at level 15).~
