All allies within 5 meters of the target also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: they will be protected by 1D6 +2 copies for 17 rounds.~

@7210 = ~Blur (Illusion)
Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round /level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The warlord discovered this spell while seeking invisibility. Its effect is more limited, but still useful.
When a blur spell is cast, the warlord causes the outline of his form to become blurred, shifting and wavering. This distortion causes all missile and melee combat attacks against the caster to be made with -2 penalties. The warlord also gains a +1 to all of his saving throws.
From level 16 the spell becomes more powerful, making his form even more indistinct: -3 penalty to attacks of opponents and +1 to all his saving throws, an additional +1 to saving throws vs. spell.~
