@7211 = ~Colossal Strength~
@7212 = ~Colossal Strength (Alteration)
Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds / 2 levels
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell is used to improve the physical strength of the warlord. When this spell is cast, the mage gains a champion's strength, determined by a die roll. The die used depends on caster level, according to the following table:
Level 3 to 5  : 1D2
Level 6 to 9  : 1D4
Level 10 to 13: 1D6
Level 14 to 17: 1D4 +2
Level 18 and +: 1D6 +2

The die result determines the Strength granted to the mage:
1: 17 strength
2: 18 strength
3: 18/33 strength
4: 18/66 strength
5: 18/99 strength
6: 19 strength (hill giant)
7: 20 strength (stone giant)
8: 21 strength (frost giant)~
