@7213 = ~Instinctive Strike~
@7214 = ~Instinctive Strike (Divination)
Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: special
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell gives the warlord, for a moment, an innate intuition to find a gap in an opponent's defenses. During the next two rounds, he gains a +8 bonus to attack and +2 to the chance to inflict a critical hit. The power of the spell increases with caster experience, the attack bonus becomes +10 at level 11, and its duration increases to three rounds at level 18.~
