@7215 = ~Dispel Magic~
@7216 = ~Dispel Magic (Abjuration)
Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell dispels magical effects on the warlord. The spell is not selective: it dispels effects from spells, abilities, items and potions, whether harmful or beneficial. Use it carefully, as it can undo preparations for battle.
When he casts Dispel Magic, the warlord has a base dispelling chance of 50%. For every level that the warlord is above the original caster, his chance of success increases by 5%. For every level that the caster of dispel magic is below the original caster, his chance of success decreases by 10%. Thus, if he is level 10 and tries to dispel a slow cast by a mage of level 12, he will have only a 30% chance of success. Conversely, if the mage who cast Slow on the warlord is of level 6, the latter will have a 70% chance to dispel the spell. In any case, there is always a 1% chance of success or failure of dispelling.~
@72161 = ~Dispel Magic (Abjuration)
Level: 2
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell dispels magical effects on the target. The spell is not selective: it dispels effects from spells, abilities, items and potions, whether harmful or beneficial. Use it carefully, as it can undo preparations for battle.
When he casts Dispel Magic, the warlord has a base dispelling chance of 50%. For every level that the warlord is above the original caster, his chance of success increases by 5%. For every level that the caster of dispel magic is below the original caster, his chance of success decreases by 10%. Thus, if he is level 20 and tries to dispel a slow cast by a mage of level 16, he will have a 70% chance of success. Conversely, if the mage who cast Slow on the warlord is of level 20, the latter will only have a 50% chance to dispel the spell. In any case, there is always a 1% chance of success or failure of dispelling.~
@721611 = ~Dispel Magic (Abjuration)
Level: 2
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: one creature
